            "sid": "LEV 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi kuMose: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshono kuAroni lamadodana akhe, labantu bonke bakoIsrayeli, uthi: Nanku iNkosi elaye ngakho isithi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uba umuntu wendlu kaIsrayeli ehlaba inkabi loba imvu loba imbuzi ezihonqweni, ingabe ngaphandle kwezihonqo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "angayilethanga emnyango wethente lokuhlangana ukuba anikele ngayo eNkosini ngaphambi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " leNkosi, uzakuba lecala legazi, ngoba echithile igazi; uzakukhutshwa ebantwini bakibo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalokho abantu bakoIsrayeli bafanele ukuletha eNkosini imihlatshelo abayihlaba egangeni, bayilethe kumpristi ngasemnyango wethente lokuhlangana, banikele ngayo ibe yiminikelo yokuthula eNkosini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umpristi uzakhaphazela igazi ealtareni leNkosi ngasemnyango wethente lokuhlangana, atshise amahwahwa, abe liphunga elimnandi eNkosini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke kabasayikuhlabela omoya ababi imihlatshelo yabo, ababesiya kubo ukuphinga sebengidela. Lokhu kuzakuba yisimiso esingelakuphela kubo ezizukulwaneni zabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
